+@Return         PVRSRV_ERROR:   PVRSRV_OK on success and the allocation content
+                                was successfully restored.
+
+                                PVRSRV_ERROR_PMR_NEW_MEMORY when the content
+                                could not be restored and new physical memory
+                                was allocated.
